<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 350-7 AT TEA ON THIRD DAY VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 350-7 AT TEA ON THIRD DAY VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 350 for the loss of seven wickets in reply to New Zealand's first innings of 124 at tea on the third day of the second cricket test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 124 (D. Patel 45, D. Gough 5-40, A. Caddick 4-45).</p>
<p>England first innings 350 for seven wickets (N. Hussain 64, G. Thorpe 108, J. Crawley 56, A. Stewart 52, S. Doull 4-59).</p>
